      "text": "It appears to me that the market was slightly fearful during Asia hours and sold off during the US session. BTC led as the crypto barometer, but some coins showed a more pronounced move.\n\nSo before I say we've \"shrugged off\" this FUD, I will simply sit out until BTC settles above 83K through an entire US session. That would be my early cue that we're back in a bullish market.\n\nAs a reminder, 10-20% dips are quite standard for BTC. It could go deeper without invalidating this bullish trend.",
